    agreement derived from the commitment (paper Eq. 3)
      ✔ ALLOW + FORCE_ALLOW -> AGREED
      ✔ ALLOW + FORCE_DENY -> NOT_AGREED
      ✔ DENY + FORCE_ALLOW -> NOT_AGREED, authorization created
      ✔ DENY + FORCE_DENY -> AGREED
